@startuml
title Quản lý danh mục
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Employee
boundary AdminPortal
control API
control CategoryService
entity PostgreSQL

Employee->AdminPortal: Chọn quản lý danh mục
AdminPortal->API: GET /categories
API->CategoryService: List categories
CategoryService->PostgreSQL: SELECT categories
PostgreSQL-->CategoryService: Category list
CategoryService-->API: Categories
API-->AdminPortal: 200 list
Employee->AdminPortal: Tạo hoặc sửa danh mục
AdminPortal->API: POST or PATCH /categories
API->CategoryService: Validate category data
CategoryService->PostgreSQL: INSERT or UPDATE category
PostgreSQL-->CategoryService: Saved category
API-->AdminPortal: 200 or 201 category
Employee->AdminPortal: Xóa danh mục
AdminPortal->API: DELETE /categories/:categoryId
API->CategoryService: Check product references
CategoryService->PostgreSQL: DELETE category
PostgreSQL-->CategoryService: Delete result or conflict
API-->AdminPortal: 204 deleted or 409 conflict
@enduml
